    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1128">

                <pb facs="0941" n="825" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg825"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/14636.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Governor of Texas to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Austin</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-03-19">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 19, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Answering your telegram 18th instant concerning transportation of wounded
                    soldiers over Texas soil to Matamoros from Nueva Laredo, beg to advise it will
                    be agreeable to State of Texas to extend this permission.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Jas. E. Ferguson</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
